{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_chiave_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_chiave_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "代表作",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_chiave_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "62c454943bdc6b245b13335412f1844577a3b680248b060b797ee0e8ef63ced2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "我一會讓人把車開過來，你儘快把我的車修好，聽懂了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "明白！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "還有你們，奧斯塔，布洛卡，給我看住這個瘋子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“看住”\n是說......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "別以為我不知道，已經有好幾個手下向我報告過了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "“賈維把我的車修好了，可他把我的儀錶盤改成了彈球遊戲機！”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "“賈維把我的音響改成了外放的！對，把車裡面的聲音往車外面放的！我和我老婆打的電話被別人聽得一清二楚！”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "所以，看住他，除了把我的車恢復原樣，我禁止他對我的車做任何改動！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "要是敢出一點差錯，你們，還有你們的修車廠......統統都要給我的女士陪葬。記住了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "記住了，老大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "可你的女士是誰？我們剛剛提過她嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "她就是車，車就是她，蠢貨！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "我真不該期待你能理解一個人對自己座駕的感情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "尤其是當她帶著自己出生入死，為自己擋下無數危險......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "嗯，我明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "你明白個*敘拉古問候語*！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "總之，等我來提車時，我要看到一個完好無損的她——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "一輛完好無損的車！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "林頓先生，您不坐坐再走？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "免了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "以你們兩個的能力，為什麼要跟這種腦子有病的傢伙待在一起？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "林頓先生，我想您沒必要總是和我討論這個問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "嘁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "既然你們鐵了心跟賈維混，與其在我身上浪費時間，不如好好想想該怎麼讓他正常一點，免得他把你們也拖下水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "奧斯塔，布洛卡，我們這下可要在懷特城揚名立萬了！我們要修的是全懷特城只此一輛的豪車！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "......這會不會是個陰謀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "別擔心，林頓真的迫切需要一個厲害的人幫他修車。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "前幾天林頓被人伏擊，他的車被打得千瘡百孔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "不過那可是找遍敘拉古都沒幾輛的頂級豪車，防彈性能一流，最後救了他一命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "但是......為什麼要讓我們修？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "因為賈維確實是懷特城裡技術最好的修車工。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "哼，奧斯塔，就算你誇我，我也不會把車借你開的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "借我開？你什麼時候成車主了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "布洛卡，拿著這張材料單，把上面的東西採購回來。要是能在半小時內回來，我可以考慮把車借你開。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "借我開就免了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "賈維，你可別想著修好之後把車開出去兜風這種蠢事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "你前腳把車開上懷特城的街道，後腳就有人去告訴林頓，不出一個小時，我們的修車廠就會被砸成一堆破爛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "那算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "我謝謝你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "不過，要是這車只有林頓能開，我就只能讓林頓自己摸索我的改造成果了，真遺憾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "你還想在車上搞改裝？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "你自己說的，那可是“找遍敘拉古都沒幾輛的頂級豪車”！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "超輕底盤，超大功率引擎，完美的空氣動力學設計......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "我有預感，只有這輛車能實現我一直以來的夢想！這是我這輩子僅此一次的機會！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "......你到底要改什麼啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "現在告訴你就沒意思了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "等到林頓來提車的那一天，我要給所有人一個做夢都想不到的驚喜——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "布洛卡，你這麼快就回來啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "快來，讓我看看你買的改裝件——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "唔唔唔嗯嗯噫嗚嗚嗚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "奧斯塔！你捂我嘴幹什麼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓的心腹",
      "text": "老大的車我給你們開過來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "我們馬上把車運進汽修車間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓的心腹",
      "text": "然後，賈維，老大讓我提醒你一件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "好說好說，什麼事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓的心腹",
      "text": "老大說，如果車修好之後讓他發現一丁點改裝的痕跡，他就把你砌進修車廠地下室的牆裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "呃，還有別的事嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓的心腹",
      "text": "這幾天我就住你們這裡了。老大讓我全程跟進你們修車這件事，免得你們偷偷搞鬼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "這......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "布洛卡，你回來得正好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "快，帶這位朋友去參觀修車廠的生活區，他要在我們這裡住幾天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "這是林頓先生的心腹，你可得把以前搞暗殺時那套習慣收一收。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "傷了他就不好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓的心腹",
      "text": "什麼暗殺——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓的心腹",
      "text": "等等，你要做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "帶你參觀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓的心腹",
      "text": "你......你別亂來！我是林頓先生派過來的，你敢動我你就完了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓的心腹",
      "text": "別、別拉我，我自己能走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "（擦汗）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "賈維，現在你知道了，你敢改林頓的車，就要被他砌進地下室的牆裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "所以，老老實實把他的車修好，別想著改裝了，算我欠你個人情，行不行？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "但是讓你欠我人情沒什麼意思啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "......那你想讓誰欠你人情？林頓？就憑你在他嚴令禁止的前提下改了他的車？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "是啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "我明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "我現在就去告訴林頓你腦袋被機油燻壞了，半年不能開工。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "別——別！奧斯塔，你聽我說！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "......說什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "我是說真的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "你是真的想被林頓砌進牆裡，我已經知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "我是說，真的，奧斯塔，沒准我以後再也遇不上這麼好的車了，這真的是一生只有一次的機會！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "你們兩個可以在改裝完成之前先逃走，我一個人對付林頓，你們等林頓對我心服口服之後再回來！我就不信他不被我的創意折服！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "就算林頓真的是個一點審美都沒有的蠢貨，看到那麼偉大的改裝還非要把我砌進牆裡不可，那我也認了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "這真的是我能做到的最最偉大的改裝了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "你可是我的好小弟，別讓我記恨你一輩子啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "（嘆氣聲）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "反正這種事上我從來攔不住你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "記得躲著點林頓的那個眼線，白天老實修車，最好等他睡了再搞你的改裝，我和布洛卡會替你打掩護的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "怎麼樣，小爺我的技術厲害吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓的心腹",
      "text": "確實，短短幾天就能修到現在這個程度......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維&奧斯塔&布洛卡",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓的心腹",
      "text": "而且......好像確實沒什麼改裝的痕跡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓的心腹",
      "text": "我上車看看可以吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "賈維？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "沒問題，看吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓的心腹",
      "text": "座椅......內飾......儀錶盤......都沒問題......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓的心腹",
      "text": "車載音響......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓的心腹",
      "text": "賈維，這個播放按鈕怎麼回事？老大給我的照片上可不是紅色的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "那個是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓的心腹",
      "text": "我告訴你們幾個，要是真敢在老大的車上搞鬼，我可沒法手下留情！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓的心腹",
      "text": "我可要按下去了，你最好在事情變得不可收拾之前老實坦白！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "那你就按吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓的心腹",
      "text": "......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "無論你走到哪裡 家族都會找到你 噢噢♪\n不管你多快 不管你多慢 噢噢♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓的心腹",
      "text": "所以你就把音響的播放按鈕換了個紅的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "差不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓的心腹",
      "text": "（搖頭）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓的心腹",
      "text": "你和老大的品味還真是相得益彰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓的心腹",
      "text": "時間不早了，老大明早來提車，我先走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "賈維，你的改裝......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "完全沒問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "你確定能藏得那麼好？剛才那傢伙不就看出播放按鈕有問題了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "藏？為什麼要藏？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "剛剛那傢伙沒什麼眼力，你讓我瞞著他，我也就忍了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "但林頓既然買了這輛車，就一定能理解我煞費苦心的改裝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "所以你的改裝多半瞞不過林頓，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "別說得那麼難聽嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "應該是“一眼就能發現我改裝的偉大之處”！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "（深呼吸）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "平靜，平靜，奧斯塔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "好，賈維，現在我需要你告訴我，你準備的驚喜到底是什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "不是說好了要保密嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "我要你現在就告訴我，我才能幫你想一個儘量不觸怒林頓的對策。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "還是別了吧，我覺得會破壞你明天的驚喜體驗——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "你現在不說，等到林頓來給我們一個驚喜，我們就全完了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "看在你這麼急的份上，你把耳朵湊過來，我偷偷告訴你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "布洛卡，你沒奧斯塔這麼急，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "布洛卡，去收拾我們所有值錢的東西，然後找一輛最快的車。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "要逃？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "以最快的速度趕緊逃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "還有你，賈維，別愣著了，趕緊收拾東西，把你覺得重要的東西都帶走！我們得頂著林頓的眼線衝出懷特城了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "我不走，不是說了嘛，林頓一定會理解我的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "他理解個——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "我這麼說，賈維，就算林頓理解，他也不可能容忍！你要是不想被砌進牆裡就趕緊收拾東西趕緊跑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "我和布洛卡還好說，你才是會實打實地沒命的那個！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "那你們兩個先走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "你呢？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "我不能走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "我要是和你們一起走了，我的改裝就永遠沒人知道了。我捨不得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "要不然就只能把那輛豪車開走，可林頓雖然人品不怎麼樣，但他還沒對我們幹什麼壞事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "他挺喜歡那輛車的，我改裝是想給他一個驚喜，不是偷他的車，讓他因為高血壓暈過去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你——\n唉！布洛卡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "把賈維綁起來帶走！我這裡有繩子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "布洛卡剛剛不是去收拾東西了嗎？要我把他給你叫過來嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "我再......想想吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "（均勻的打呼聲）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "奧斯塔，十點了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "是啊，十點了。虧他還能睡著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "他不光不怕林頓，連我們趁他睡著把他綁走都不怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "如果天亮之前想不到好辦法——\n等等......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "我想到了！我想到了！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "布洛卡，等賈維醒了告訴他，明天按原計劃進行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "讓他一定要把那個驚喜做到十二分......不，二十分！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "老大，車我給你開過來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "賈維，你確實是城裡最好的修車工。至少在修車這一點上，我沒找錯人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "等我回了辦公室，再考慮給你們多少報酬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "我不用報酬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "怎麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "只要能讓我再開一段，幫你把車開回去就行，用這個當報酬就足夠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "真不要錢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "（點頭）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "那太好了。要是從車庫裡開過來不夠過癮，你就直接把我送回辦公室吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "今天沒看到奧斯塔啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "我也沒看到他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "我早上可聽說，昨天夜裡，奧斯塔從你的修車廠開著輛車出去了。過了不久，布洛卡也走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "嘖嘖嘖，真不夠朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "但他們至少還算聰明人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "林頓的目光落在二人中間的紅色按鈕上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "你能騙過我那個笨蛋手下，但你騙不過我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "音響的播放按鈕為什麼是圓的，周圍還帶一圈防滑紋，能不能請你給我解釋一下？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "這個嘛——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "因為這是個旋鈕！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "旋鈕！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "告訴我，你在這個旋鈕上附加了什麼功能？總不至於是音量旋鈕吧，那也太不賈維了——\n我說得對不對？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "老大，我覺得與其跟你解釋，不如讓我親自示範一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "承認了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "那傢伙向我報告的時候，我還以為你轉性了，沒想到還是舊習難改。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "老老實實把車開到我的辦公室，然後等待發落！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "不許做任何多餘的事，尤其是不許碰那個紅色旋鈕。我會緊緊盯著你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "可這樣就沒音樂聽了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "在聽音樂之前，小子，先想好遺書怎麼寫吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "前面右轉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "老大，你這輛車的手感真不錯，要不然我也不會——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "現在恭維我已經晚了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "怎麼回事？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "*敘拉古問候語*，又搞這一套？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "賈維，該不會是你把那幫人引來的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "*豐富多彩的敘拉古問候語*，這可是小爺我剛修好的車！你們瘋了吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "（小聲）看來不是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "要不是還有事沒做，我現在就撞爛你們這幫*敘拉古粗口*！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "小心那邊的汽油桶！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "看到了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "（拍方向盤）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "哈哈，孬種，這下炸到自己人了吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "別鬆懈，他們還有車跟在後面！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "知道！我看得一清二楚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "不遠了，我們就快到了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "老大，在那之前，我還有件事要請求你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "有什麼事之後再說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "不行，你必須現在答應我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "如果是改裝的事，我們已經一筆......一筆勾銷了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "不，老大，不是這個！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "那還能是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "在我被砌進地下室的牆裡之前，我要親眼看著你把搞伏擊的這幫混蛋帶到我面前來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "我要讓他們哭著給她道歉！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "“她”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "就是這輛車！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "這輛我沒日沒夜地改了一整個星期的車！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "等等......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "等等，那是什麼？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "他們居然開了一輛卡車橫在路口？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "快減速，蠢貨，要撞上去了，再加速就撞上去了！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "然而賈維的手死死握在打正的方向盤上，油門也絲毫未鬆。\n卡車的車身眼看越來越近。\n慌不擇路的林頓試圖搶下賈維的方向盤，與此同時，賈維把手伸向了汽車音響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "你？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "賈維把旋鈕一轉到底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "無論你走到哪裡 家族都會找到你 噢噢♪\n不管你多快 不管你多慢 噢噢♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "你還有心情放......音......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "樂？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "音樂開始的同時，咆哮的引擎聲很快蓋過了豪華車載音響播放的流行歌曲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "與此同時，林頓感到一陣前所未有的顛簸，加速度把他死死按在座椅上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "而豪車外面的人們看見，車身兩側伸出短短的滑翔翼，車底噴出黑煙，車頂迅速打開，裡面鑽出兩架展開之後大得超乎想像的無人機——\n整輛汽車搖搖晃晃地飛了起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "清晨你對著火拼肆虐後的景象哭泣 噢噢♪\n你明明漸入佳境 卻突然開始失控 噢~噢~噢噢噢♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "老大，你車上都是些什麼歌啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "我切首更適合這個偉大時刻的歌，你沒意見吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "林頓臉色發白，整個人僵在座椅上一動不動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "埃萊娜 我的名字是埃萊娜♪\n我是一名魯珀♪\n和其他的魯珀一樣♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "不對，這首也俗得要命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "今夜無人入眠 今夜無人入眠♪\n高貴的女士 連你也是一樣♪\n你要在寂寥寒冷的房間♪\n心急如焚地觀望 那因夢想而閃爍的星光♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "這首勉強湊合吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "......著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "老大，你說什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "你......你給我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "（牙齒打顫聲）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "等......著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "哦，嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "但是我真沒想到這兩架改大了的無人機能支撐這麼遠——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "——比我預期的多堅持了十幾秒吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "老大，我們要降落了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "降......落......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "就是“掉下去”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "掉下去？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "你放心，我會儘量讓這個過程緩和一點的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "兩架無人機在空中相繼散架，汽車底部噴出的黑煙漸漸散去。\n伴著令人熱淚盈眶的音樂，還有林頓撕心裂肺的尖叫聲，汽車開始向下俯衝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "老大，我們到了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "到、到、到......到了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "我都說了，你放心就好，落地時的減震可是我花心思最多的地方，一定能平安降落的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "平安......降落......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "......她呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "她？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "林頓沒再理睬賈維，顫抖著手擰了擰插在孔裡的車鑰匙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "她......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "她徹底離你而去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "賈維！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "給我等著，我馬上就把你砌進——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "記者A",
      "text": "林頓先生，林頓先生！我是《懷特城郵報》的記者，請問這次飛行實驗是您的主意還是這位賈維先生的主意？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "記者B",
      "text": "請問您是特意為了這次實驗而購買了這輛豪車嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "記者C",
      "text": "請問您在實驗開始之前的心情如何？您在空中有沒有什麼特別的感受？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "記者D",
      "text": "我們剛剛注意到，您的車在實驗開始之前似乎遭到了伏擊，請問這是為什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......\n？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "林頓先生，這當然是您自己的主意對吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "呃......啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "至於這輛豪車，則是林頓先生為了這次偉大的實驗忍痛提供的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "對吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "呃，是我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "毅然決然地把車交給賈維，一切都是為了確保實驗能安全完成？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "（數次深呼吸）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "沒錯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "至於在空中的心情......在傑出歌唱家歌聲的陪伴之下，我俯視著懷特城的街景，那是何等的心潮澎湃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林頓",
      "text": "而那些來伏擊我的傢伙，不過是一幫不肯抬頭仰望星空的宵小罷了，甚至不值得去關注......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "記者A",
      "text": "賈維先生，作為這次實驗的實際執行者，您的感想如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "棒極了！我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "抱歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "奧斯塔，都怪你，報紙上整版都是昨天林頓那傢伙大談特談的飛行心得，我只有一張被布洛卡打暈的醜臉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "話也不能這麼說，畢竟車確實是林頓的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "從面子上講，你完成了“他的計劃”，讓他成了懷特城的大發明家，生平第一次上法治新聞以外的版面，他沒理由對你動手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "至於裡子，他的車被你毀了，但你反過來救了他一條命，在我看來，無論如何也扯平了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "當然，那群搞伏擊的傢伙也來得真是時候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "我半夜去找記者的時候只想著讓他為了面子沒法動手。可沒想到，你這改裝居然還能把自己變成他的救命恩人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "我還是不甘心啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "豪車以後沒准還有，小爺我這樣的腦子可是絕無僅有......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "text": "贊成。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "嗯？布洛卡，你是在誇我對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "賈維，你要是還不服氣，我可以告訴你，他在半空中伴著音樂嚎得很慘，我在他辦公大樓門口都聽見了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "順便，還有件事沒上報紙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "你在懷特城已經有新外號了，雖然是和林頓共用的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "text": "請進！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "興奮的市民",
      "text": "請問是“飛天者”賈維的修車廠嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "興奮的市民",
      "text": "我也要給自己的車來個超酷的改裝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
